# Phase 5 (May 2026): /studio/contact/ alias.
#
# Per launch plan Part II, the canonical contact path moves from
# /window/ to /studio/contact/ — the latter is more discoverable to
# time-poor owners searching "contact" rather than the metaphorical
# "window," and translates straight to /es/studio/contact/. The
# infrastructure (auth, message handling, Worker routes) still lives
# under /window/, so we 302 the new URL to the existing surface
# rather than rebuild the backend. 302 (not 301) so we can flip the
# canonical later without bleeding the search-engine cache.
/studio/contact/                  /window/                  302
/studio/contact                   /window/                  302
/es/studio/contact/               /es/window/               302
/es/studio/contact                /es/window/               302

